Package: emaxProjection
Type: Package
Title: Confidence-Region Projection for Integrated Emax Responses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bahadır", "Yüzbaşı", email = "bahadir.yuzbasi@inonu.edu.tr",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes confidence-region projections for integrated responses
    in a closed nonnegative Emax model with an unrestricted baseline. Supports
    centered contrast and full mean-region calibration for independent Gaussian
    errors with a common unknown variance and fixed replicated dose levels.
    An RcppArmadillo numerical core returns outer intervals, feasible witnesses,
    endpoint gaps, and explicit feasibility and termination diagnostics.
    Floating-point enclosures are not directed-rounding certificates.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
